The [[Tywelwyn's|Tywelwyn's]] twins are the names behind half the exquisite handiwork circulating the [[Ward|ward's]] markets — yet ask any stallholder and you'll find the pair keep no shop of their own, preferring commissions and quiet reputation. One is a brother; the other's face is rather less spoken of.
